{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47705","headline":"遗简诗 二 · 赵惠宗","name":"遗简诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾驾时马，日月爲卫。\n洞耀九霄，上谒天帝。\n明明我衆，及我门人。\n僞道养形，真道养神。\n懋哉懋哉，余无所陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵惠宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}